name=RefugeZ Motorcycle Pack
id=RZMotos
author=Rafa
description=RefugeZ Motorcycle Pack adds 19 self-contained vehicles to Project Zomboid Build 42: 17 motorcycles, a three-seat tuk-tuk and a two-bike trailer. Works in single player and multiplayer, and requires no other mods.<LINE><LINE>MOTORCYCLES<LINE>Old West Bike, Ghost Rider, CWS M111 with sidecar, CWS M111 Halloween, AKT TT 200 DS (stock, Premium Matte and Matte), Honda CRF 450, Honda Motra, Honda Shadow RS 2010, Harley-Davidson, Harley Custom v1.2, Harley-Davidson Electra Glide Police, Street Three (stock and Matte), Post-Apo and the Delivery Electric Scooter.<LINE><LINE>FEATURES<LINE>- Dedicated rider animations for every bike: riding, stopped with the foot on the ground, reverse, arms following the handlebar, mounting and dismounting from the side.<LINE>- Animated wheels, discs and front end, removable parts and storage, and its own mechanics screen.<LINE>- 102 craftable motorcycle parts under the Tuning category, with English and Brazilian Portuguese translations.<LINE>- Police siren and flashing blue/red lights on the Electra Glide (radial menu, V key).<LINE>- Rechargeable battery on the electric scooter.<LINE>- A hard crash throws the rider off; a fallen bike can be stood back up with "Right the motorcycle".<LINE>- Tuk-tuk handled as a car, with a central driver, two passengers and vanilla occupant animations.<LINE>- Trailer that loads and unloads nearby motorcycles from the context menu.<LINE>- Detailed 4K matte textures, world spawns and parts in loot.<LINE><LINE>CRAFTING<LINE>Every part is made in the Tuning category and the recipes start locked. The RefugeZ Motorcycle Maintenance Manual teaches all 102 of them, and a character also learns a recipe on their own three levels above the skill it requires.<LINE>- Seats and tires (worn, standard, performance): Mechanics 2. Converted from the vanilla part, which keeps its condition.<LINE>- Windscreens: Mechanics 1.<LINE>- Fenders, top cases, panniers and cargo racks: Welding 4, with a blowtorch, welding mask, sheet metal and screws.<LINE>- Fuel tanks: Welding 5.<LINE>- Old West side holster: Tailoring 3. Post-Apo cargo pack: Tailoring 4, with leather strips, thread, a needle and scissors.<LINE>- Delivery scooter traction battery: Electrical 3 and Mechanics 2, consuming a whole car battery, which keeps its charge.<LINE>The manual spawns in garages, auto shops, car supply stores, bookstores and in the top case of the motorcycles themselves.<LINE><LINE>COMPATIBILITY<LINE>Compatible with Viewpoint.<LINE><LINE>ABOUT<LINE>This mod was made with AI and designed exclusively for my own use, but it is free for everyone to use.<LINE><LINE>Model credits and licenses: CREDITS.md inside the mod folder.
